   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "Given this backdrop, the Group is expecting a similar level of demand in the second half of the year and accordingly expects FY24 adjusted operating profit will be around £150m, inclusive of £5-10m of property profits and around £(16)m of losses in Toolstation France.",
